IdLib
├── toMandateId
│   ├── given the same mandate
│   │   └── it should derive the same id (deterministic)
│   └── given a different salt
│       └── it should derive a different id
├── toActionId
│   └── given a different selector
│       └── it should derive a different id
└── toConfigId
    └── given the same (mandateId, actionId)
        └── it should derive the same id (deterministic)
